{"id":"n24571-1-7","stage":2,"title":"일종 · 一种","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24571-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 이건 이름이 뭐예요?","zh":"妈妈，这个叫什么名字呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이건","audio":"/audio/5a674df42cc1d8ac9ff2.mp3"}},{"text":"이름이","meaning":"名字，名称","explanation":"이름：名字，名称；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름이","audio":"/audio/7664b0b2ec8a24b4d722.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐예요","audio":"/audio/4f5cef3090eaab6a16ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"名字，名称","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"为了区别于他物，给动物、事物、现象等而赋予的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/269bd34f5d144a100d4f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24571-1-7-2","ko":"풀의 일종인데 이름을 잘 모르겠구나.","zh":"这是种草，不过我不太知道它的名字呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"풀의","meaning":"草","explanation":"풀：草；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"풀","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73268","senseId":"1","lemma":"풀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풀의","audio":"/audio/9aa408777b84969038dd.mp3"}},{"text":"일종인데","meaning":"一种","explanation":"일종：一种；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"일종","audio":"/audio/dd9dbc82eddb0b587b6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24571","senseId":"1","lemma":"일종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일종인데","audio":"/audio/2749c989ea142c8f96c4.mp3"}},{"text":"이름을","meaning":"名字，名称","explanation":"이름：名字，名称；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름을","audio":"/audio/c2024c1d7bd90d3cff86.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠구나.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠구나","audio":"/audio/65b51418dbe31d985b15.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9f4ab3b56eddc42c","term":"풀","zh":"草","audio":"/audio/9f4ab3b56eddc42cf4c9.mp3","entryId":"73268","definition":"一种茎秆柔软的植物，大部分为一年生。","pronunciation":["풀"]},{"id":"dd9dbc82eddb0b58","term":"일종","zh":"一种","audio":"/audio/dd9dbc82eddb0b587b6f.mp3","entryId":"24571","definition":"某物的一个种类；或指一个品种。","pronunciation":["일쫑"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"名字，名称","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"为了区别于他物，给动物、事物、现象等而赋予的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/880915e84c6956a58721.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.065,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24571","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，这个叫什么名字呀？","这是种草，不过我不太知道它的名字呢。","在学校附近找到房子了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，这个叫什么名字呀？","这是种草，不过我不太知道它的名字呢。","在学校附近找到房子了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
